<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1817576399"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1711714030"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Fool For You"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="KASTRA"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Fool For You"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:27.273"><div begin="00:08.100" end="03:20.808"><p begin="00:08.100" end="00:11.700" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:08.100" end="00:08.365">I</span> <span begin="00:08.365" end="00:08.686">been</span> <span begin="00:08.686" end="00:09.202">running</span> <span begin="00:09.202" end="00:09.713">over</span> <span begin="00:09.713" end="00:10.300">leaving</span> <span begin="00:10.300" end="00:10.535">in</span> <span begin="00:10.535" end="00:10.806">my</span> <span begin="00:10.806" end="00:11.700">head</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">离开的念头一直萦绕在我的脑海里</span></p><p begin="00:12.374" end="00:17.484" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:12.374" end="00:13.021">Tripping</span> <span begin="00:13.021" end="00:13.537">over</span> <span begin="00:13.537" end="00:13.804">all</span> <span begin="00:13.804" end="00:14.053">the</span> <span begin="00:14.053" end="00:14.553">stupid</span> <span begin="00:14.553" end="00:14.877">things</span> <span begin="00:14.877" end="00:15.127">you</span> <span begin="00:15.127" end="00:16.108">said</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:15.726" end="00:17.484"><span begin="00:15.726" end="00:16.017">(Things</span> <span begin="00:16.017" end="00:16.257">you</span> <span begin="00:16.257" end="00:17.484">said)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说过的那些傻话让我心烦意乱</span></p><p begin="00:16.794" end="00:20.605" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:16.794" end="00:17.058">I</span> <span begin="00:17.058" end="00:17.320">keep</span> <span begin="00:17.320" end="00:18.425">stalling,</span> <span begin="00:18.700" end="00:18.986">and</span> <span begin="00:18.986" end="00:19.306">now</span> <span begin="00:19.306" end="00:19.529">I'm</span> <span begin="00:19.529" end="00:20.605">falling</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我裹足不前 现在我沉沦其中 无法自拔</span></p><p begin="00:20.880" end="00:24.503" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:20.880" end="00:21.107">It's</span> <span begin="00:21.107" end="00:21.422">like</span> <span begin="00:21.422" end="00:21.679">I'm</span> <span begin="00:21.679" end="00:22.098">con</span><span begin="00:22.098" end="00:22.504">stant</span><span begin="00:22.504" end="00:22.779">ly</span> <span begin="00:22.779" end="00:23.206">ques</span><span begin="00:23.206" end="00:23.640">tio</span><span begin="00:23.640" end="00:23.903">ning</span> <span begin="00:23.903" end="00:24.503">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就好像我在不停地怀疑你一样</span></p><p begin="00:25.453" end="00:27.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:25.453" end="00:25.699">So</span> <span begin="00:25.699" end="00:25.899">if</span> <span begin="00:25.899" end="00:26.098">you</span> <span begin="00:26.098" end="00:26.503">want</span> <span begin="00:26.503" end="00:27.000">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若你对我充满渴望 你为什么让我伤心欲绝</span></p><p begin="00:27.728" end="00:31.361" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:27.728" end="00:27.957">Why</span> <span begin="00:27.957" end="00:28.116">are</span> <span begin="00:28.116" end="00:28.280">you</span> <span begin="00:28.280" end="00:28.683">tea</span><span begin="00:28.683" end="00:28.854">ring</span> <span begin="00:28.854" end="00:29.181">me</span> <span begin="00:29.181" end="00:29.340">a</span><span begin="00:29.340" end="00:29.741">part?</span> <span begin="00:29.741" end="00:29.918">It's</span> <span begin="00:29.918" end="00:30.251">killing</span> <span begin="00:30.251" end="00:30.448">me</span> <span begin="00:30.448" end="00:30.875">slow</span><span begin="00:30.875" end="00:31.361">ly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么要让我经受撕裂之痛</span></p><p begin="00:32.074" end="00:35.706" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:32.074" end="00:32.444">Watching</span> <span begin="00:32.444" end="00:32.632">you</span> <span begin="00:32.632" end="00:33.012">hide</span> <span begin="00:33.012" end="00:33.552">behind</span> <span begin="00:33.552" end="00:33.687">your</span> <span begin="00:33.687" end="00:34.079">scars,</span> <span begin="00:34.079" end="00:34.298">not</span> <span begin="00:34.298" end="00:34.523">here</span> <span begin="00:34.523" end="00:34.701">when</span> <span begin="00:34.701" end="00:34.849">I</span> <span begin="00:34.849" end="00:35.168">need</span> <span begin="00:35.168" end="00:35.706">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看着你隐匿在伤疤的掩映</span></p><p begin="00:36.124" end="00:38.136" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:36.124" end="00:36.309">I</span> <span begin="00:36.309" end="00:36.486">been</span> <span begin="00:36.486" end="00:36.839">trying</span> <span begin="00:36.839" end="00:37.019">to</span> <span begin="00:37.019" end="00:37.342">pull</span> <span begin="00:37.342" end="00:38.136">through</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">努力地  我寻求自我的康复</span></p><p begin="00:38.443" end="00:42.002" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:38.443" end="00:38.648">You</span> <span begin="00:38.648" end="00:38.871">play</span> <span begin="00:38.871" end="00:39.054">with</span> <span begin="00:39.054" end="00:39.231">my</span> <span begin="00:39.231" end="00:39.707">mind,</span> <span begin="00:39.707" end="00:39.960">play</sp