pan begin="01:29.040" end="01:29.301">still</span> <span begin="01:29.301" end="01:29.719">hold</span> <span begin="01:29.719" end="01:30.559">tight</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">眼前尽是模糊的界线 我依然不会松开紧握的双手</span></p><p begin="01:30.728" end="01:34.489" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:30.728" end="01:31.289">Hoping</span> <span begin="01:31.289" end="01:31.567">you</span> <span begin="01:31.567" end="01:31.919">give</span> <span begin="01:31.919" end="01:32.272">me</span> <span begin="01:32.272" end="01:33.007">something</span> <span begin="01:33.007" end="01:33.447">that</span> <span begin="01:33.447" end="01:33.708">is</span> <span begin="01:33.708" end="01:34.489">real</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望你能为我付出一些真挚的爱意</span></p><p begin="01:35.309" end="01:36.806" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:35.309" end="01:35.543">So</span> <span begin="01:35.543" end="01:35.706">if</span> <span begin="01:35.706" end="01:35.919">you</span> <span begin="01:35.919" end="01:36.337">want</span> <span begin="01:36.337" end="01:36.806">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若你对我充满渴望 你为什么让我伤心欲绝</span></p><p begin="01:37.539" end="01:41.182" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:37.539" end="01:37.750">Why</span> <span begin="01:37.750" end="01:37.927">are</span> <span begin="01:37.927" end="01:38.091">you</span> <span begin="01:38.091" end="01:38.488">tea</span><span begin="01:38.488" end="01:38.665">ring</span> <span begin="01:38.665" end="01:38.992">me</span> <span begin="01:38.992" end="01:39.151">a</span><span begin="01:39.151" end="01:39.552">part?</span> <span begin="01:39.552" end="01:39.729">It's</span> <span begin="01:39.729" end="01:40.062">killing</span> <span begin="01:40.062" end="01:40.259">me</span> <span begin="01:40.259" end="01:40.686">slow</span><span begin="01:40.686" end="01:41.182">ly</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又为什么甘愿将我投掷痛苦之中</s